    "title": "Traditional Festivals in Ghana & Cultural Heritage",
    "description": "Study major Ghanaian festivals (Homowo, Hogbetsotso, Aboakyer, Odwira, Kundum, Damba) and communal values.",
    "isFreeTrial": true,
